From efa8fb28dfba1fa16b7c5a5193abd171049c29c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:02:18 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] rpcserver: export NFS proxy generation coverage

Write one durable, atomic JSON record for each target-mode program result
when experimental.nfs_proxy_evidence is configured. The record joins the
executor activation correlation with canonicalized remote KCOV PCs, and
failures stop the runner instead of silently dropping Stage 2 evidence.
---
